  ('CHE-2070', 'Chemistry', 'Industrial chemistry', 'Addition polymers', 'easy', 'Markhor Prep original question', 'The monomer shown undergoes addition polymerisation. What is the polymer?', '<svg version=''1.1'' xmlns=''http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'' width=''300px'' height=''180px'' viewBox=''0 0 300 180''><path d=''M 250.5,71.9 L 163.3,122.3'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 243.0,58.8 L 163.3,104.9'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 163.3,122.3 L 81.2,75.0'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 167.7,119.8 L 163.3,122.3 L 159.2,120.0'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;stroke-miterlimit:10;'' /><path d=''M 49.5 73.0 Q 49.5 66.0, 52.8 62.3 Q 56.1 58.6, 62.4 58.6 Q 68.2 58.6, 71.3 62.7 L 68.7 64.9 Q 66.4 61.9, 62.4 61.9 Q 58.1 61.9, 55.8 64.7 Q 53.6 67.6, 53.6 73.0 Q 53.6 78.6, 55.9 81.5 Q 58.2 84.4, 62.8 84.4 Q 65.9 84.4, 69.6 82.5 L 70.7 85.5 Q 69.2 86.5, 67.0 87.0 Q 64.7 87.6, 62.2 87.6 Q 56.1 87.6, 52.8 83.8 Q 49.5 80.1, 49.5 73.0 '' fill=''#000000''/><path d=''M 74.2 56.9 L 77.9 56.9 L 77.9 87.2 L 74.2 87.2 L 74.2 56.9 '' fill=''#000000''/></svg>', '["Polyvinyl chloride (PVC)", "Polythene", "Polytetrafluoroethene (PTFE)", "Nylon-6,6"]', 0, 'The monomer is chloroethene (vinyl chloride), CH₂=CHCl. Its C=C opens and many units join to give –(CH₂–CHCl)ₙ–, polyvinyl chloride.', '{"1": "Polythene is made from ethene, which has no chlorine.", "2": "PTFE (Teflon) is made from tetrafluoroethene, CF₂=CF₂.", "3": "Nylon-6,6 is a condensation polymer of a diamine and a diacid."}', 1),
  ('CHE-2071', 'Chemistry', 'Industrial chemistry', 'Addition polymers', 'easy', 'Markhor Prep original question', 'Which polymer is made from the monomer shown?', '<svg version=''1.1'' xmlns=''http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'' width=''300px'' height=''180px'' viewBox=''0 0 300 180''><path d=''M 36.0,122.9 L 93.1,155.6'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 40.9,114.3 L 93.1,144.2'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 93.1,155.6 L 150.0,122.5'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 150.0,122.5 L 207.1,155.2'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 159.9,116.8 L 207.1,143.8'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 207.1,155.2 L 264.0,122.1'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 264.0,122.1 L 263.8,56.3'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 254.1,116.4 L 253.9,62.0'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 263.8,56.3 L 206.6,23.6'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 206.6,23.6 L 149.8,56.7'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 206.7,35.0 L 159.7,62.3'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 149.8,56.7 L 150.0,122.5'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;'' /><path d=''M 90.3,154.0 L 93.1,155.6 L 96.0,154.0'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;stroke-miterlimit:10;'' /><path d=''M 204.3,153.6 L 207.1,155.2 L 210.0,153.6'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;stroke-miterlimit:10;'' /><path d=''M 261.2,123.8 L 264.0,122.1 L 264.0,118.8'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;stroke-miterlimit:10;'' /><path d=''M 263.8,59.6 L 263.8,56.3 L 260.9,54.6'' style=''fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-width:2.0px;stroke-miterlimit:10;'' /><path d=''M 209.5,25.2 L 206.6,23.6 L 203.8,25.2