''18'' text-anchor=''middle'' dominant-baseline=''middle'' fill=''#000'' font-weight=''bold''>−</text></svg>', '["Both charges are positive", "The charges are of opposite sign", "Both charges are negative", "The field between the charges is zero"]', 1, 'Field lines start on a positive charge and end on a negative charge. Here the lines leave the left charge and curve round into the right one, so the charges are opposite. The field is strongest between them, where the lines crowd together.', '{"0": "Between two positive charges the lines push apart and there is a neutral point midway with no lines.", "2": "Between two negative charges the lines would point inwards to both charges and avoid the middle.", "3": "The lines are most crowded between the charges, so the field there is strong, not zero."}', 1),
