35.2,196.7 341.9,197.7 348.7,198.6 355.4,199.5 362.2,200.3 369.0,201.1 375.7,201.8 382.5,202.5'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''2.4'' stroke-linejoin=''round'' stroke-linecap=''round''/><line x1=''139.1'' y1=''121.8'' x2=''139.1'' y2=''214.0'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''1.2'' stroke-linecap=''round'' stroke-dasharray=''4 4''/><line x1=''139.1'' y1=''121.8'' x2=''58.0'' y2=''121.8'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''1.2'' stroke-linecap=''round'' stroke-dasharray=''4 4''/><line x1=''220.2'' y1=''167.9'' x2=''220.2'' y2=''214.0'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''1.2'' stroke-linecap=''round'' stroke-dasharray=''4 4''/><line x1=''220.2'' y1=''167.9'' x2=''58.0'' y2=''167.9'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''1.2'' stroke-linecap=''round'' stroke-dasharray=''4 4''/></svg>', '["6 days", "3 days", "1.5 days", "12 days"]', 1, 'The count rate falls from 800 to 400 counts per minute in 3 days, and from 400 to 200 in the next 3 days. The time for the activity to halve is always 3 days.', '{"0": "In 6 days the count rate falls to a quarter (800 to 200), which takes two half-lives.", "2": "At 1.5 days the count rate is still about 566, well above half.", "3": "12 days is four half-lives: the rate falls to 50 counts per minute."}', 1),
